{
  "$doc": "H5.1 walk matrix — read by scripts/walk-hr.mts. One entry in `states` = one screen state of brief §4 (row = brief row #). cells = viewers × sizes × langs. Path placeholders: {hr} {bogus} {paidRun} {paidRunPeriod} {thisMonth} {today} {yesterday} {rosterWeek} {unit.<key>} {emp.<key>} (seed-hr-qc employees + walk 'view') {run.DRAFT|APPROVED|PAID|REVERSED} {period.DRAFT|APPROVED|PAID|REVERSED} (seed-hr-walk). `page` = inventory page key = route folder. `pathBy` overrides the path per viewer. `expectFinal` = path the browser must end on (redirect). `moneyOk` = viewers allowed to see money on this state (own pay). `limitedNote` = selector that must exist for the listed viewers (partial totals). `allowScroll` = selectors of declared horizontal scrollers (WARN not FAIL). `click` = selector pressed before the shot (state, not a mutation). `extra` = beyond the brief's 84 cells. `todoInventoryPrefix` = state is skipped until the inventory has rows with that testid prefix (tickets not yet merged).",
